 "notes": [
  "Gen 3 Doubles OU: Blissey's Hidden Power (Fire) hits a frozen Ariados (`-damage|p2b: Ariados|191/344 frz`), which stays frozen. pokeemerald's `Cmd_datahpupdate` counts Hidden Power's damage as its base type's (`F_DYNAMIC_TYPE_IGNORE_PHYSICALITY`: Normal, physical), so no `specialDmg` is set and `MOVEEND_DEFROST` passes it by; Showdown's gen3 `frz.onDamagingHit` reads the dex type. The engine thawed it (DESIGN.md R-M11-53). Minimized from the Nightly battle m9-gen3doublesou-s338-012"
